  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אַחַת דִּבֵּר אֱלֹקִים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְהָפַךְ סִדְרֵי עוֹלָמִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">צֵא מִן הַתֵּבָה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לֵךְ לְךָ מֵאַרְצְךָ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בֹּא אֶל פַּרְעֹה,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנִי הִכְבַּדְתִּי לִבּוֹ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בֹּאוּ וּרְשׁוּ אֶת הָאָרֶץ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כִּי אֲנִי אֲדוֹנֵי הָאָרֶץ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אַחַת דִּבֵּר אֱלֹקִים,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אָמַר לַעֲבָדָיו הַנְּבִיאִים.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><p data-end=\"314\" data-start=\"127\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יֵשׁ רֶגַע שֶׁבּוֹ נִשְׁמַעַת קְרִיאָה פְּנִימִית: צֵא, לֵךְ, בּוֹא.</span></p><p data-end=\"314\" data-start=\"127\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הִיא נִרְאֵית מֻכֶּרֶת - אַךְ בְּכָל פַּעַם הִיא מְבַקֶּשֶׁת מִמְּךָ לַעֲזֹב מַשֶּׁהוּ אַחֵר.</span></p><p data-end=\"314\" data-start=\"127\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אַל תִּדְחֶה אֶת הַקּוֹל הַזֶּה; הוּא הַדֶּרֶךְ שֶׁבָּהּ ה' מַזְמִין אוֹתְךָ לִצְעֹד צַעַד נוֹסָף בַּמַּסָּע שֶׁלְּךָ</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">\"<i>אַחַת דִּבֵּר אֱלוֹקִים - שְׁתַּיִם זוֹ שָׁמַעְתִּי</i>\"</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הדיבור האלוקי אחד הוא - המאזין לו מגלה רבדים רבים.</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2><p data-end=\"262\" data-start=\"128\">\"<i>וַיֹּאמֶר יְ-ה-וָ-ה אֶל מֹשֶׁה בֹּא אֶל פַּרְעֹה</i>\" (ספר שמות) = <strong data-end=\"186\" data-start=\"178\">1048</strong><br data-end=\"189\" data-start=\"186\" />\n\"יַצִּילֵנִי מֵאֹיְבִי עָז מִשֹּׂנְאַי כִּי אָמְצוּ מִמֶּנִּי\"&nbsp;&nbsp;(ספר שמואל) = <strong data-end=\"262\" data-start=\"254\">1048</strong></p><p data-end=\"186\" data-start=\"67\">\n</p><p data-end=\"490\" data-start=\"264\">המספר שווה - גם המסר.<br data-end=\"289\" data-start=\"286\" />\nהציווי <em data-end=\"317\" data-start=\"296\">“בֹּא אֶל פַּרְעֹה”</em> נראה כמסע אל תוככי הסכנה,&nbsp;אך בתוך הקריאה טמונה ההצלה<em data-end=\"490\" data-start=\"462\">.</em></p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span><b style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;</b></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><b><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></b></p></span><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><b>בֹּא</b>' / '</span><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><b>עוֹל</b>'</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><br /></span></span></span></span></span>❖ תתקרב, תגיע - תעלה</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b>מָאֵן</b>' / '<b>מְסָרֵיב</b>'<br /></span></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;לא מסכים, לא רוצה - מסרב</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>'<b>בִּגְבֻלֶךָ</b>' / '<b>בִּתְחוּמָךְ</b>'<br /></span>❖ בשטח שלך - בתחום שלך</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span style=\"background-attachment: initial; background-clip: initial; background-image: initial; background-origin: initial; background-position: 0px 0px; background-repeat: initial; background-size: initial; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'<b>לְמוֹקֵשׁ</b>' / '<b>לְתַקְלָא</b>'<br /></span></span></span></span><span style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">❖</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">&nbsp;פגע - תקלה</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">'</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><b>כַּחֲצֹת</b>' / '</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><b>כְּפַלְגוּת</b>'</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><br /></span></span></span>❖ באמצע, בזמן ההתחלקות - ההתפלגות</span></li></ol><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div><br /></div><h2 style=\"display: inline; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"></span></div>👁️ מבט חד</span><br /></h2><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\"><br /></div></span></div></div><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"float: right;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjXTWkPMy2RNFlpMtztiZ0pqTB-3v6XuDBkWV05ZiYAQPqifmiAiAvjrDHygJsuIwKmV84Zt3bJZ-BrYJPf5cX7ew6d74ZjkUcxKIGjG9dQVB9hjHZg7HhVa8ZL83hpTWSlhyphenhyphenG7yK-TB8GODwngmv489iM_tKwD9k7wg_Ys2u9VoVqspzzjIYYrVRmuFyc/s1024/ChatGPT%20Image%20Nov%2010,%202025,%2006_40_31%20PM.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"clear: right; margin-bottom: 1em; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img alt=\"לב שבתוכו מצפן זוהר, מסמל את ההכוונה האלוקית הפנימית הפועלת בלב האדם\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1024\" data-original-width=\"1024\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjXTWkPMy2RNFlpMtztiZ0pqTB-3v6XuDBkWV05ZiYAQPqifmiAiAvjrDHygJsuIwKmV84Zt3bJZ-BrYJPf5cX7ew6d74ZjkUcxKIGjG9dQVB9hjHZg7HhVa8ZL83hpTWSlhyphenhyphenG7yK-TB8GODwngmv489iM_tKwD9k7wg_Ys2u9VoVqspzzjIYYrVRmuFyc/w200-h200/ChatGPT%20Image%20Nov%2010,%202025,%2006_40_31%20PM.png\" width=\"200\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">צו ה’ - צופן מצפוני</span></td></tr></tbody></table>"
}
